{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "https://docs.qauth.dev/schemas/admin-permissions.json",
  "title": "QAuth admin permission catalog",
  "description": "Every permission of the admin API, retired ones included, by id, with its class and the release that retired it. Generated from apps/auth-server/src/app/helpers/admin-permissions.ts; the stable-surface check reports a removed permission or a changed class as a break. The ids are promised from 1.0.0 on (ADR-018 §5).",
